flowchart LR
  subgraph INPUT[Inputs to prompt]
    Q[Question]
    SC[Selected code<br/>optional]
    RC[Retrieved chunks<br/>up to 5]
  end
  subgraph LLM[Prompt + LLM]
    P[Structured prompt] --> M[OpenAI-compatible<br/>/chat/completions<br/>non-streaming]
  end
  subgraph OUTPUT[Output]
    A[Answer<br/>with citation markers]
    E[Cited evidence<br/>document + page + excerpt]
  end
  Q --> P
  SC --> P
  RC --> P
  M --> A
  M --> E
